<title>USA: Sun Healthcare sees Q4 loss after charges.</title>
<headline>Sun Healthcare sees Q4 loss after charges.</headline>
<dateline>ALBUQUERQUE, N.M. 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sun Healthcare Group Inc said Wednesday it expects to report a fourth-quarter loss of $0.01 to $0.04 per share, including pre-tax charges of $26 million for certain adjustments and non-recurring items.</p>
<p>Excluding the charges, it will have a profit of $0.28 to $0.31 per fully diluted share, the company said.</p>
<p>It said it would report full results later this month.</p>
</text>
